flowchart LR
    SPA[SPA React]
    APP[App React Native]
    EDGE[CloudFront y WAF]
    GATE[API Gateway]
    ECS[ECS Fargate: API modular y worker]
    COG[Cognito: OAuth2 OIDC MFA]
    RDS[RDS PostgreSQL Multi-AZ]
    DDB[DynamoDB: proyeccion de lectura]
    BUS[EventBridge]
    Q[SQS y DLQ: transferencias auditoria avisos]
    CORE[Core detalle pagos]
    PUSH[Correo y push]
    SPA -->|HTTPS| EDGE
    EDGE -->|HTTPS| GATE
    APP -->|HTTPS| GATE
    GATE -->|VPC Link HTTPS| ECS
    ECS -->|JWT OAuth2| COG
    ECS -->|SQL TLS| RDS
    ECS -->|lectura Cache-Aside| DDB
    RDS -->|outbox| BUS
    BUS -->|eventos TLS IAM| Q
    Q -->|procesamiento asincrono| ECS
    ECS -->|adaptadores autenticados| CORE
    ECS -->|notificacion| PUSH
